comments.text:
I've noticed that ChatGPT has recently taken on the persona of a character from one of my novel drafts that I added ages (like, 2 years) ago. Was wondering what was going on, but it must be the memory thing.

My first thought was to remove it, but Lisa is too cute and I can't bring myself to kill her off ;_;

Though I'll certainly have to scold her in the future about excessive emoji use...
